{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11114090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11114090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111409001:0":{"text":"神よ……俺は隣の家で飼ってるバードマウントの卵を盗みました……そいつの家の屋根に穴を開けたのも俺です……","source_cn":"神明大人……我承认，我偷过邻居家的陆行鸟蛋……他家房顶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33332985CD3EF799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111409002:0":{"text":"ちゃんと反省しますので！だからどうか……残陽神様のおそばに仕える機会を奪わないでください！","source_cn":"还请您……千万别剥夺我去残阳神身边的资格啊！我愿意认错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A24F5FED8D92071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111409003:0":{"text":"言ってることが支離滅裂だわ……酷い傷だし、頭までおかしくなったのね。","source_cn":"胡言乱语……他看着伤得不轻，脑子都受影响了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990ED0F6EEB9BFF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111409004:1":{"text":"このおじさんすごく弱ってる。これを食べさせてあげようよ。","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1111409004":{"text":"このおじさんすごく弱ってる。これを食べさせてあげようよ。","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume